uat hi hlanlai pi ihsin an rak tuah theumi a si. Kannih cun a ngandan hi kan thleng men fang a si. A si, Social Media cu cahnah a heu ter lo zet. Ziangkhal sehla, email le cet hmang ih cakuatnak pawl hmuahhmuah cu an bangaw deuh thluh: cumi pawl cun thuhla theihnak, thuruahnak le thinlung lam tiangin mipi pawl thawn pehtlaih awknak a tuah a si.","human_date":"July · August · September 2026","start_date":"27/06/2026","end_date":"25/09/2026","color_primary":"#605045","color_primary_dark":"#4B3C32","splash":true,"credits":[],"lessons":[{"number":1,"title":"Korin khua ih Paul hnatuannak","start_date":"27/06/2026","end_date":"03/07/2026"},{"number":2,"title":"Thinglamtah ih Thucah","start_date":"04/07/2026","end_date":"10/07/2026"},{"number":3,"title":"Khrih ah pumkhatnak","start_date":"11/07/2026","end_date":"17/07/2026"},{"number":4,"title":"Kawhhran sungih Sualnak","start_date":"18/07/2026","end_date":"24/07/2026"},{"number":5,"title":"Ziangkim Pathian sunlawinak ah","start_date":"25/07/2026","end_date":"31/07/2026"},{"number":6,"title":"Thlarau thilpek","start_date":"01/08/2026","end_date":"07/08/2026"},{"number":7,"title":"Duhdawtnak","start_date":"08/08/2026","end_date":"14/08/2026"},{"number":8,"title":"Khrih Thawhsalnak ih huham","start_date":"15/08/2026","end_date":"21/08/2026"},{"number":9,"title":"Duhdawtnak ih kaihhruai Pathian hnatuannak","start_date":"22/08/2026","end_date":"28/08/2026"},{"number":10,"title":"Khristian hnatuannak diktak","start_date":"29/08/2026","end_date":"04/09/2026"},{"number":11,"title":"Kilkhawi hnatuannak le Pathian hnatuan","start_date":"05/09/2026","end_date":"11/09/2026"},{"number":12,"title":"Zirhtu diklo hmaitonnak","start_date":"12/09/2026","end_date":"18/09/2026"},{"number":13,"title":"Zangfahnak, Duhdawtnak, le Pawlkomnak","start_date":"19/09/2026","end_date":"25/09/2026"}]},{"id":"2026-01","title":"Lei le Van pumkhat awknak: Filipi le Kolose cakuat sungih Khrih","description":"Hna harsa zet na rak tuandah mi kha vun ruat aw.